{title: We're Marching to Zion}
{artist: Isaac Watts & Robert Lowry}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 92}

Verse 1
Come, [G]we that love the [C]Lord, and [G]let our joys be [D]known;
join [G]in a song with [C]sweet ac[G]cord, join [D]in a song with [Em]sweet accord,
and [G]thus surround the [D]throne, and [G]thus sur[D]round the [G]throne.

Chorus
We're [G]marching to Zion, [C]beautiful, beautiful [G]Zion;
we're marching upward to [C]Zion, the [G]beautiful [D]city of [G]God.
